# Non-thinking base: qwen3:4b emits a <think> block of hundreds to thousands of
# tokens before answering, which on this GPU costs minutes per call.
FROM qwen3:4b-instruct

# 4096, not 8192. The KV cache is allocated for the full context whether or not
# it is used: at 8k it took 1152 MiB of a 4 GB card and pushed 12 of the model's
# 37 layers onto the CPU. Measured against the recorded traffic, the largest
# prompt this agent has ever built is 2207 tokens (p95 2203), and the drafting
# role is capped at 1100 completion tokens — so 4096 still leaves ~1.9k of
# headroom over the worst case seen, while freeing ~576 MiB for more layers.
PARAMETER num_ctx 4096
